-- l4 lint fixture: the same prose as lint-subject-to-missing.l4, and this time
-- the body calls the decision for section 6. No finding.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(1) — granted to more than 4 persons` n MEANS
    n GREATER THAN 4

@ref Probate Act s 8(3) — "Subject to section 6, probate may be granted to one or more of the persons so appointed."
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 8(3) — probate may be granted` n MEANS
        "Subject to section 6,"
    ... NOT (`s 6(1) — granted to more than 4 persons` n)
    ... n GREATER THAN 1
